   Tang, Xueqin and Petersen, Rene Horsleben and Ng, Calvin S. H. and
   Fiorelli, Alfonso and Novoa, Nuria M. and Bedetti, Benedetta and Sandri,
   Giovanni Battista Levi and Hochwald, Steven and Lerut, Toni and Sihoe,
   Alan D. L. and Barchi, Leandro Cardoso and Gilbert, Sebastien and
   Waseda, Ryuichi and Toker, Alper and Gonzalez-Rivas, Diego and Fruscio,
   Robert and Scarci, Marco and Davoli, Fabio and Piessen, Guillaume and
