Abstract = {Meta-analysis has become the conventional approach to synthesizing the
   results of empirical economics research. To further improve the
   transparency and replicability of the reported results and to raise the
   quality of meta-analyses, the Meta-Analysis of Economics Research
   Network has updated the reporting guidelines that were published by this
   Journal in 2013. Future meta-analyses in economics will be expected to
   follow these updated guidelines or give valid reasons why a
   meta-analysis should deviate from them.},
